WEBVTT

00:29:27.138 --> 00:29:31.423
You know, being able to manage
this aspirational,

00:29:31.447 --> 00:29:35.218
very human-centric brand,

00:29:35.242 --> 00:29:38.062
you know, you've got
to really operate tightly

00:29:38.086 --> 00:29:44.261
and I think the world is becoming
less tolerant of a deviation

00:29:44.285 --> 00:29:47.371
from your actions and your words.

00:29:47.395 --> 00:29:48.602
And so I think

00:29:48.626 --> 00:29:52.110
that's something companies are going
to have to be very thoughtful about

00:29:52.134 --> 00:29:54.664
as they establish these brands
and what they stand for

00:29:54.688 --> 00:29:55.848
and their values

00:29:55.872 --> 00:29:58.287
and they better be prepared
to really live by them.

00:29:58.311 --> 00:30:00.335
AG: Yeah, I guess that goes
to the question